        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result of the removal of Holden Hills Phase 1 from Austin’s extraterritorial jurisdiction (ETJ) pursuant to the ETJ Law, as described below, we may need to modify our development plans for portions of Holden Hills Phase 1 to benefit from the new regulations.",
